        nums.sort()
        seen = set()
        for mask in range(1 << len(nums)):
            seen.add(tuple(nums[i] for i in range(len(nums)) if mask >> i & 1))
        return [list(s) for s in seen]
```

**Time:** O(n · 2ⁿ)
